  m_Name: Butcher
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Pavle
  LastName: Asatiani
  Nickname: The Butcher
  Occupation: Butcher
  CharacterDescription: "Looks creepy and unsettling because he has bandages covering
    his face due to an accident with the meat grinder. Is actually a nice guy though
    has a bit of sadistic humor.\t"
  CharacterArc: Looks creepy and unsettling with bandages covering a "meat grinder
    accident" on his face. Initially possesses a sadistic sense of humor, but eventually
    becomes a vessel for a supernatural hunger as doomsday approaches.
  DateOfBirth: 14/03/1952
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 18 NOV
  IsResident: 1
