  exitDialoguesPassed:
    lastVerdict: 1
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - "Stop by later. I\u2019ll give you a 'cut' of the profits. Get it?"
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - "Try to stay plump, officer. It\u2019s a better look for you."
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Go on. The world is just one big cold-storage anyway.
  exitDialoguesQuarantined:
    lastVerdict: 2
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Solitary? Well, at least I won't have to share my lunch.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - "I\u2019ll be practicing my knife skills on the wallpaper. Don't worry."
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - A box is a box. Eventually, we all get wrapped up.
  exitDialoguesKilled:
    lastVerdict: 3
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Aw, and I was just starting to like your face.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - "A bit overkill, don't you think? I\u2019m already half-mummified."
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - There it is... the big... silent... punchline.
  quarantineExitLines:
  - Solitary confinement? My favorite kind of kitchen. Very private.
  - "Oh good. I\u2019ve been meaning to practice my patience."
  - The walls look very chewy. I'll let you know how they taste.
  killExitLines:
  - First clean cut I've ever been on the receiving end of...
  - "Hm. Thought it would sting more. I\u2019m almost... impressed."
  - "There\u2019s something almost poetic... about going out this cleanly..."
